  \oobeWelcome\LaunchNarratorInstruction:
    Candidate Language=BE-BY: To set up your device using a screen reader, turn on Narrator by pressing Windows + Control + Enter. For more accessibility features, press Windows + U, or select the Accessibility icon in the bottom corner.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro5VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=BE-BY: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=BE-BY: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
